<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Revamping an Online Store | Quadem Digital</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Case study on revamping an online store for higher conversions by Quadem Digital Enterprise.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/animations.css">
    <style>
        .case-study-hero {
            padding-top: 150px;
            padding-bottom: 80px;
            text-align: center;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.1), transparent 50%);
        }
        .case-study-content {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .case-study-content h2 {
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .case-study-content p {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .case-study-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 400px;
            background-color: #1a1a24;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 20px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="navbar scrolled" id="navbar">
        <div class="container navbar-container">
            <a href="/" class="logo active-logo">
                <span class="logo-text">Quadem <span class="logo-highlight">Digital</span></span>
            </a>
            <div class="nav-cta">
                <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-pill">Book a Call</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="case-study-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="work-tag" style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: block; margin-bottom: 16px;">E-commerce</span>
            <h1>Revamping an Online Store for Higher Conversions</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">We completely redesigned the user experience, leading to a massive spike in sales.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container case-study-content">
        <div class="case-study-image">Cover Image 1</div>
        <h2>The Challenge</h2>
        <p>The client's e-commerce platform was experiencing a high cart abandonment rate and low overall conversion rate. The user interface was outdated, the checkout process was clunky, and the mobile experience was subpar.</p>
        
        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>We conducted a comprehensive UX audit to identify friction points. Based on our findings, we redesigned the entire user journey, focusing on a mobile-first approach, streamlined checkout, and high-quality product visuals. We also implemented strategic upsell and cross-sell placements.</p>
        
        <h2>The Results</h2>
        <div class="work-result" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <span class="result-metric">300%</span>
            <span class="result-text">Increase in website traffic</span>
        </div>
        <p>Within the first three months of launch, the client saw a 300% increase in overall traffic and a 150% boost in online sales. The cart abandonment rate dropped by 40%.</p>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 60px;">
            <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-ghost btn-pill">← Back to Projects</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="container footer-container" style="padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
            <p class="copyright">&copy; 2026 Quadem Digital Enterprise. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
